    "summary": "A small girl&#039;s pubic apron, &quot;ghabi&quot;, consisting of a small tubular belt to which is attached a cotton cloth panel, along the lower edge of which is a thick fringe of plaited tassels. The belt is completely covered with small sections of glass beadwork of various colours; one side of the cloth panel is covered with triangular beadwork motifs in white, blue, black, pink and green, and with an openwork fringe of the same colours; each of the tassels is tipped with a group of white beads.",
